{'symbol': 'NDAQ', 'date': '2023-06-23 17:26:00', 'title': 'NASDAQ CLOSING CROSS CALCULATES RUSSELL US INDEXES RECONSTITUTION FOR 20TH CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': 'NEW YORK, JUNE 23, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NASDAQ, INC. (NASDAQ: NDAQ) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE NASDAQ CLOSING CROSS WAS USED FOR THE 20TH CONSECUTIVE YEAR TO REBALANCE NASDAQ-LISTED SECURITIES IN THE ENTIRE FAMILY OF RUSSELL US INDEXES, PART OF LEADING GLOBAL INDEX PROVIDER FTSE RUSSELL, DURING ITS ANNUAL RECONSTITUTION. APPROXIMATELY 2.55 BILLION SHARES REPRESENTING $61.7 BILLION WERE EXECUTED IN THE NASDAQ CLOSING CROSS IN 0.86 SECONDS ACROSS NASDAQ-LISTED SECURITIES.'}